# Deploy — arjunabadger.press

This repo generates the library site; **Render serves the live custom domain**.

When asked to deploy, release, publish, or ship — read and follow the full runbook in the
companion repo:

`../arjuna-badger-platform/.claude/skills/deploy/SKILL.md`

Minimum loop from this repo:

1. `python3 site/build.py`
2. Rsync `site/public/` → `../arjuna-badger-platform/saas/web/public/`
3. Push `master` (this repo) + `main` (platform)
4. **Render redeploy** (`RENDER_DEPLOY_HOOK_URL` or Manual Deploy) — required for live site

Engine manuscript sync (before step 1 when prose changed in platform):

`../arjuna-badger-platform/tools/sync_library.sh`
